# The `hep-cv-private` package

Private CV bibliography filters and environments

## Introduction

The `hep-cv-private` package adds private CV bibliography filters and
environments on top of the HEP CV bibliography setup. It groups work,
visits, education, supervision, funding, talks, publications, software,
theses, and service entries by keyword, provides specialised CV
bibliography environments for those groups, and formats Indico event and
contribution links as eprint data.

It can be loaded with `\usepackage{hep-cv-private}`.

